      "text": "Joseph … not willing to make her a publick example, Matt. 1:19. Let your light so shine before men, Matt. 5:16 (3 Ne. 12:16). I have given you an example, that ye should do as I have done, John 13:15. I am the way, the truth, John 14:6. set thee to be a light of the Gentiles, Acts 13:47. all these things happened unto them for ensamples, 1 Cor. 10:11. ye shine as lights in the world, Philip. 2:15. ye have us for an ensample, Philip. 3:17. ye were ensamples to all that believe, 1 Thes. 1:7. make ourselves an ensample unto you to follow, 2 Thes. 3:9. Jesus Christ might shew forth all longsuffering, for a pattern, 1 Tim. 1:16. be thou an example of the believers, 1 Tim. 4:12. the prophets … for an example of suffering, James 5:10. Christ … leaving us an example, that ye should follow, 1 Pet. 2:21. being ensamples to the flock, 1 Pet. 5:3. making them an ensample unto … ungodly, 2 Pet. 2:6. Sodom and Gomorrha … set forth for an example, Jude 1:7.",
